### Get all categories
GET http://localhost:3000/api/category

### Create category - Electronics
POST http://localhost:3000/api/category
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Electronics",
  "description": "Electronic devices and accessories",
  "isActive": true
}

### Create category - Fashion
POST http://localhost:3000/api/category
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Fashion",
  "description": "Clothing, shoes, and accessories",
  "isActive": true
}

### Create category - Home & Garden
POST http://localhost:3000/api/category
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Home & Garden",
  "description": "Furniture, decor, and garden supplies"
}

### Get category by ID (replace :id with actual ID)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/category/1

### Update category (replace :id with actual ID)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/category/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Electronics & Gadgets",
  "description": "Updated description for electronics category"
}

### Update category active status
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/category/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isActive": false
}

### Delete category (replace :id with actual ID)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/category/1
